Hi B6,

Welcome to =C2=A0
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Creately is the World=E2=80=99s first work management software that runs on=
 a smart visual canvas. We are here to help you to make the most of your =
workday by bringing together everything you need to get your work done in =
one single place.=C2=A0

[Open Creately](https://app.creately.com/)

Let's get you started
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

2 Min video guide=F0=9F=91=87

Creately comes with 100s of features that can be customized for any type of=
 work. Learn how to use all the features like a pro and seamlessly =
integrate your daily projects and processes within Creately!

**Get to know your Creately Workspace =F0=9F=91=8B=F0=9F=8F=BB**
------------------------------------------

Creately workspaces are essentially built on a smart visual canvas which =
gives you complete freedom to add, arrange, and move any item on it any way=
 you like. Everything you want to start - from folders to shape libraries =
to templates - is on the left-side panel & toolbar.

**Add your data =F0=9F=97=83 =EF=B8=8F=C2=A0**
----------------------

Each shape on your structure can hold a magnitude of information. Open =
Shape Data on the right-side panel to add notes and additional data fields =
to any item on the canvas and convert your structure into a visual database=
. =C2=A0

**Share and collaborate with your team =F0=9F=A4=9D**
------------------------------------------

Invite collaborators to edit or review your workspace. Connect with them =
via video chat, monitor changes with real-time cursor tracking, and discuss=
 and plan key details with proper in-context comments and tasks.

